infrastructure (NTN payload(s) & NTN Gateway(s)). It provides control data, e.g. Ephemeris, to the non-NTN
infrastructure gNB functions of the gNB. Provision of NTN control data to the gNB is out of 3GPP scope. NOTE: The transport of NR-Uu protocol between the NTN Service Link provisioning system and the non-NTN
infrastructure gNB functions is out of 3GPP scope. At least the following NTN related parameters are expected to be provided by O&M to the gNB for its operation:
a) Earth-fixed beams: for each beam provided by a given NTN-payload:
- The Cell identifier (NG and Uu) mapped to the beam;
